---
import PennantBanner from "../components/PennantBanner.astro";
import WheelApp from "../components/WheelApp.tsx";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Roleta Premiada Giro Floripa"
  description="Gire a roleta do Giro Floripa e saia com prêmio garantido para usar na sua primeira visita. Boteco e samba em Canasvieiras."
>
  <PennantBanner />

  <main id="main-content" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-5 py-8 sm:px-8 lg:flex lg:min-h-[calc(100vh-2rem)] lg:flex-col lg:px-10 lg:py-10">
    <section
      class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:flex-1 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.94fr)_minmax(25rem,0.86fr)] lg:gap-14 xl:gap-20"
    >
      <div class="max-w-2xl text-center lg:text-left">
        <div
          class="mx-auto mb-6 flex h-17 w-17 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-white/80 bg-giro-paper shadow-[0_10px_22px_rgba(42,24,16,0.12)] lg:mx-0"
        >
          <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" class="h-12 w-12" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="28" fill="#8B1E1E"></circle>
            <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="20" fill="none" stroke="#E3A008" stroke-width="3"></circle>
            <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="5" fill="#E3A008"></circle>
            <path d="M32 12v10M32 42v10M12 32h10M42 32h10" stroke="#FFF6E8" stroke-width="3"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-giro-gold/45 bg-giro-gold/20 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[0.7rem] font-extrabold tracking-[0.16em] text-giro-red uppercase">
          <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-giro-red" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          Por tempo limitado
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs font-extrabold tracking-[0.22em] text-giro-terracotta uppercase sm:text-sm">
          Giro Floripa · Canasvieiras
        </p>
        <h1 class="mt-3 max-w-[11ch] font-display text-[clamp(3rem,8vw,5.75rem)] leading-[0.92] tracking-[-0.035em] text-giro-red max-lg:mx-auto">
          Todo giro sai com <span class="text-giro-terracotta">prêmio</span>
        </h1>
        <div class="mx-auto mt-6 h-px w-16 bg-giro-gold lg:mx-0" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p class="mt-5 text-base font-bold leading-relaxed text-giro-ink sm:text-lg">
          Uma rodada, um prêmio na hora para usar na sua primeira visita ao boteco. Leva 5 segundos.
        </p>
        <ol class="mx-auto mt-7 flex max-w-md flex-col gap-3.5 text-left lg:mx-0">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span
              class="mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-giro-red font-display text-xs font-bold text-white"
              >1</span
            >
            <p class="text-sm leading-6 text-giro-ink/75">
              <strong class="font-extrabold text-giro-ink">Gire a roleta.</strong> Sem cadastro, é só
              clicar.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span
              class="mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-giro-red font-display text-xs font-bold text-white"
              >2</span
            >
            <p class="text-sm leading-6 text-giro-ink/75">
              <strong class="font-extrabold text-giro-ink">Resgate o prêmio.</strong> Nome e WhatsApp
              para gerar seu cupom.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span
              class="mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-giro-red font-display text-xs font-bold text-white"
              >3</span
            >
            <p class="text-sm leading-6 text-giro-ink/75">
              <strong class="font-extrabold text-giro-ink">Aproveite.</strong> Mostre o código no
              balcão do Giro.
            </p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-white/65 bg-white/35 px-4 pt-4 pb-6 shadow-[0_18px_45px_rgba(42,24,16,0.08)] backdrop-blur-[2px] sm:px-7 sm:pt-6">
        <WheelApp client:load />
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="mt-12 border-t border-giro-ink/15 pt-6 text-center text-xs leading-relaxed text-giro-ink/70 lg:text-left">
      <p>
        Promoção por tempo limitado, válida na primeira visita, enquanto durar a campanha. Um cupom
        por pessoa, não cumulativo com outras ofertas. Mostre o código no balcão.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2">
        Rua Madre Maria Vilac, 1773 · Canasvieiras, Florianópolis ·
        <a class="font-bold underline decoration-giro-gold underline-offset-3" href="https://www.instagram.com/giro.floripa/">@giro.floripa</a>
      </p>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Layout>
